$T$ and a point $t_0\,\in\, T$ such that $\SE\big\vert_{X\times \{t\}}$ is stable for each $t\,\neq\, t_0$ and $\SE\big\vert_{X\times \{t_0\}}\,\cong\, E$.
\end{corollary}

