ref_dict.cor.homotopy.groups:
\begin{corollary}[Theorem \ref{thm.HFP.groups}]\label{cor.homotopy.groups}
     There exists an isomorphism of abelian groups,
     $$
     \begin{aligned}
     \pi_*((\MSpinR)^{hC_2}) &\cong \pi_*\big(\bigvee_{I}\kuRangle{4|I|}^{hC_2} \vee \bigvee_{z \in Z} \Sigma^{|z|}\HZmod^{hC_2}\big) \\
     &\cong \bigoplus_{I \in \mathcal{P}} (\pi_*\ko\langle 4 |I| \rangle \oplus \bigoplus_{m\geq1} \mathbb{Z}/2\{\delta^m_I\}) \oplus \bigoplus_{z \in Z, n \geq 1} \Z2\{w^n_z\}, 
     \end{aligned}
     $$
    where  $|\delta^m_I| = 4|I| - 4m$ when $|I|$ is even,  $|\delta^m_I| = 4|I| - 2 - 4m$ when $|I|$ is odd, and $|w^n_z| = |z| - n$.
\end{corollary}

