ref_dict.cor:markov-no-deg:
\begin{corollary}\label{cor:markov-no-deg}
Let $(a,b,c)\in \zz_{\geq 2}^3$ be a Markov triple.
Then, the weighted projective plane $\pp(a^2,b^2,c^2)$ has no non-trivial $\qq$-Gorenstein klt degenerations.
