\subsection{Principal result} Before stating our results we need to define the class of solutions to the IBVP \eqref{IBVP} to which it applies. Thus, we shall rely on the following well-posedness result
which is a consequence of the arguments deduced in \cite{BSZ2} and \cite{Fa}.

